MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: AkazukinWorldStoryLocalizeTable_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1c9e2ebee3df31d468de296b17edc071, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 6652592680960
    m_Localized: "Grandma, you haven\u2019t seemed as lively as usual lately...\nYou
      look a little pale."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6652634624000
    m_Localized: I wonder what I can do to help you feel better...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6652634624001
    m_Localized: "Oh, h-hello! Sorry, I was just a little lost in thought...\nI\u2019m
      Little Red Riding Hood. And who might you be?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6652634624002
    m_Localized: "\u2026\nSo your name is Charlotte? What a lovely name."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6652634624004
    m_Localized: "\u2026I see! You\u2019re suggesting I make some delicious food
      and bring it to her?\nYes, that really might make her happy!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6652634624003
    m_Localized: "\u2026Eh? You\u2019re asking if something\u2019s troubling me?\nWell\u2026
      actually, yes. My usually cheerful grandma has seemed down lately, and she\u2019s
      been shutting herself away at home.\nI just don\u2019t know what I can do to
      cheer her up..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6652634624005
    m_Localized: "Eh! You\u2019ll help me too, Charlotte?!\nThank you so much! I\u2019m
      not very good at cooking."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6652634624006
    m_Localized: "I wonder what Grandma\u2019s favorite food was...\nI think it was
      something with eggs in it..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6652634624007
    m_Localized: "Hmm... I can\u2019t remember... What was it again...?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2454972074323968
    m_Localized: "...Who are you?\nI don\u2019t recognize you around here..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2454972086906880
    m_Localized: "\u2026Charlotte, huh? That\u2019s a nice name.\n\u2026! You\u2019re
      Anna\u2019s daughter, aren\u2019t you? I see... Indeed, you look a lot like
      her..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2454972086906881
    m_Localized: "\u2026Me?\n\u2026I\u2019m just a simple hunter.\n\u2026What?\nLittle
      Red Riding Hood is looking for Grandma\u2019s favorite food...?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2454972086906882
    m_Localized: "\u2026If I remember correctly, her favorite dish was an omelette.\nThey
      say the secret ingredient is mushrooms...\nBut what kind of mushrooms... Sorry,
      I just can\u2019t recall..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2454972086906883
    m_Localized: "\u2026Still, I never thought that old woman would lose her strength.\nShe
      used to beat wolves with her bare hands back in the day..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2454972086906884
    m_Localized: "Speaking of food...\nI once heard from Anna a long time ago.\nThere\u2019s
      a dish that makes you strong just by eating it..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2454972086906885
    m_Localized: "\u2026Still, I never expected that old woman to suddenly fall ill...\n\u2026Is
      a great storm coming...?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5078026860392448
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m pretty sure\u2026 eggs are used, that much I remember\u2026\nBut\u2026
      I just can\u2019t recall the other ingredient no matter what\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5078026885558272
    m_Localized: "Oh, we meet again. Hello.\nI still can\u2019t remember it myself\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5078026885558273
    m_Localized: What?! The hunter said Grandma likes mushroom omelettes!?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5078026885558274
    m_Localized: "That\u2019s it! Mushroom omelettes! I\u2019m sure that\u2019s the
      one!\nEggs\u2026 and mushrooms\u2026 That would make a wonderful dish\u2026!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5078026885558275
    m_Localized: "\u2026But even the hunter can\u2019t remember which mushroom it
      was...\nThere are so many kinds of mushrooms\u2026 hmm..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5078026885558276
    m_Localized: "Ah\u2026! That\u2019s right, that\u2019s it.\nGrandma used to gather
      yellow mushrooms a lot.\n\u201CThese have the best aroma and go well with omelettes,\u201D
      \nshe said\u2026 I think it was something like that\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5078026885558277
    m_Localized: "The mushrooms look a bit\u2026 unusual, though\u2026\nBut if Grandma
      liked them, then I\u2019m sure that\u2019s it.\n\u2026Probably\u2026 no, definitely,
      that\u2019s it!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5078026885558278
    m_Localized: "Thank you. Talking with you helped me remember something important.\nI\u2019m
      going to go look for those yellow mushrooms!\nGrandma will surely be happy\u2026
      hehe."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5066752051146752
    m_Localized: "Grandma\u2026! Are you alright\u2014what\u2014!?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5066752051146753
    m_Localized: Grrrrrooooaaaarrr!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5066752051146754
    m_Localized: "W-what\u2026! How could you\u2026!\nStop it, Mr. Wolf!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5066752051146755
    m_Localized: "\u2026That\u2019s it! There\u2019s no other choice\u2026!\nTake
      this! Grandma\u2019s\u2026 mushroom omelette!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5066752051146756
    m_Localized: Grrrraaaarrr!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5066752051146757
    m_Localized: "S-stunned\u2026!? Why!?\nI thought those yellow mushrooms were
      a bit strange\u2026\nGrandma, how did you eat this\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22746171543638016
    m_Localized: "Excuse me!\nI\u2019m going to take Grandma to a safe place,\nso
      could you please hold off the wolf until then?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5066752051146758
    m_Localized: "Thank you so much\u2026 I really feel reassured\u2026!\nI\u2019m
      glad you\u2019re here\u2026!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10298475710017536
    m_Localized: "Once I get Grandma to a safe place, I\u2019ll call the hunter right
      away!\nI\u2019ll be back soon for sure\u2026 Please stay safe until then!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20124448520392704
    m_Localized: Wow, thank you so much for saving me. That was a close call...!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20124448537169920
    m_Localized: "Oh my\u2026 well, well\u2026 you were the one who saved me\u2026\nThank
      you so very much\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20124448537169921
    m_Localized: "\u2026Sorry for being late. But I\u2019m glad you\u2019re safe."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20124448537169922
    m_Localized: "You\u2026 look familiar somehow\u2026?\nHehe\u2026 Ah, that\u2019s
      right. You\u2019re Anna\u2019s\u2026 Anna\u2019s grandchild\u2026 aren\u2019t
      you?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20124448537169923
    m_Localized: "I haven\u2019t eaten Anna\u2019s cooking in such a long time\u2026
      and that\u2019s why my body\u2026 well\u2026 stopped moving properly\u2026\nHehe\u2026
      to think a wolf managed to catch up with me, I really am clumsy\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20124448537169924
    m_Localized: "\u2026! You\u2019re the one who runs the shop\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20124448537169925
    m_Localized: "Well, well\u2026 really\u2026 I get to taste that gentle flavor
      again\u2026\nHehe\u2026 I feel like I might live a little longer now\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20124448537169926
    m_Localized: "\u2026That taste again\u2026 Not bad."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20124448537169927
    m_Localized: 'Grandma and the hunter look so happy!

      I want to try it too...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20124448537169928
    m_Localized: "\u2026That\u2019s right! Next time, the three of us will definitely
      go to the shop together!\nI\u2019ll order a lot to show my thanks!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20124448537169929
    m_Localized: "Hehe\u2026 yes\u2026 Next time, I want to relax and eat my fill\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20124448537169930
    m_Localized: "\u2026Looks like it\u2019s going to be lively."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20124448537169931
    m_Localized: "Thank you very much for today. \nThanks to you, Charlotte, I was
      saved!\nLet\u2019s meet at the shop next time!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
